{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/967770-how-would-i-dice-roll-for-this","id":967770,"title":"How would I Dice Roll for this?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Vampire: The Requiem"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-09-11T22:11:51-07:00","id":967770,"title":"How would I Dice Roll for this?","content":"In the scene, my character, is going to be singing, but it will be for only one person, not a performance hall or a concert, like he's used to, but one solitary person. What difficulty, should it be at?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12039-punkmaniak","name":"PunkManiak","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12039_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"275"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-11T22:15:03-07:00","id":967774,"title":"","content":"The standard difficulty?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3953-dwight","name":"Dwight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3953_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-11T22:19:03-07:00","id":967778,"title":"","content":"CofD/nWoD have literally never had shifting difficulties. You roll your dice pool (in this case, almost certainly Presence or Manipulation plus Expression) and count any result of an 8 or better as a success.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-11T22:20:35-07:00","id":967779,"title":"","content":"Just re-rolled, it was a failure. However given the situation he's in, singing likely wouldn't be easy for him.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12039-punkmaniak","name":"PunkManiak","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12039_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"275"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-11T22:34:18-07:00","id":967787,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>PunkManiak</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/967770-how-would-i-dice-roll-for-this?p=967779#post967779\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Just re-rolled, it was a failure. However given the situation he's in, singing likely wouldn't be easy for him.</div> </div> </div> </div>That difficulty would be expressed in the form of dice pool penalties.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-11T22:39:19-07:00","id":967790,"title":"","content":"@Charlaquin<br /> <br /> I usually can get an STs help with this, but it's late here, and even then, we live in different time zones. Either way, a failure works just as well for story purposes, so I'll take what I've got.<br /> <br /> P.S. I'll keep that in mind for the future, but I doubt re-rolling a second time, without even speaking to them, would be acceptable.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12039-punkmaniak","name":"PunkManiak","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12039_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"275"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-11T22:46:25-07:00","id":967791,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/967770-how-would-i-dice-roll-for-this?p=967778#post967778\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">CofD/nWoD have literally never had shifting difficulties. You roll your dice pool (in this case, almost certainly Presence or Manipulation plus Expression) and count any result of an 8 or better as a success.</div> </div> </div> </div>Nice to see someone familar with Classic World of Darkness where &quot;difficulty&quot; meant the number needed to be rolled on the die and dice pool penalties was expressed by rolling less dice and those were entirely spearate things; However it is clear from context that the Original Poster was referencing the current lexicon where &quot;difficulty&quot; is expressed as die pool penalties, as noted by <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar269_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"269\" data-vbnamecard=\"269\">Charlaquin</a> . To answer the Original Poster, I believe a penalty of 1 or 2 is appropriate for mere unfamilarity, though pressure from it being a life-or-death performance could raise it to 3, and that doesn't take into account bonuses or penalties for accustics of the place proformed (Well-built Concert Halls/recording studios often give bonuses which the performer may be used to. An echoing parking garage or bare-walled boxy room have aweful accustics.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><i>\u201cYouth ages, immaturity is outgrown, ignorance can be educated, and drunkenness sobered, but stupid lasts forever.\u201d </i>~ <b>Aristophanes</b><br /> <i>&quot;Virescit Vulnere Virtus&quot;</i> ~ <b>Stewart Clan Motto</b></div> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/801713-homebrew-of-pale_crusader\" target=\"_blank\">Frailty Chronicles</a></span><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/801713-homebrew-of-pale_crusader\" target=\"_blank\">;</a><b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/801713-homebrew-of-pale_crusader\" target=\"_blank\">Understanding the power of limitations.</a></b></div>","edited":{"userid":3279,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3279-pale_crusader","user":"Pale_Crusader","date":". 09-12-2016, 01:50 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3279-pale_crusader","name":"Pale_Crusader","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3279_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"841"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}